include README.md
include INSTALL.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include LICENSE
recursive-include docs *.md
# The sdist is a source snapshot of the package and its documents, not a test bed: setuptools
# would otherwise pull tests/test_*.py in without the helpers, tools/ and the files they read
# (CLAUDE.md, .github/), a suite that fails at import for whoever unpacks it. The wheel is the
# product; the tests live in the repository.
prune tests
